flowchart TD
    A[Client Request] --> B[JWT Token]
    B --> C{Token Valid?}
    C -- No --> X[401 Unauthorized]
    C -- Yes --> D[Extract User]
    D --> E[Load User Role]
    E --> F[Load Permissions]
    F --> G{Required Permission Exists?}
    G -- No --> Y[403 Forbidden]
    G -- Yes --> H[Controller]
    H --> I[Service]
    I --> J[Database]
    I --> K[Audit Service]
    K --> L[(Audit Logs)]
    J --> M[API Response]
